      "id": "step-1",
      "description": "Write v2 result tests for merge (TDD red step). Cover every exit path: pass (squash-merge success), pr_fallback (gate absent/fail → PR opened), error on branch-is-main, error on push failure, error on gh pr create failure, error on gh pr merge failure, interrupted disposition on signal-death rc from gh. Assert result_contract=2, verdict, disposition, reason are present and non-empty in merge-result.json on every path. Tests must FAIL before step-3 is implemented.",
      "files": [
        "tests/unit/merge-v2-result-test.sh"
